" Your own vim plugins, loaded inside the wsl2-dev plug#begin()/plug#end().
" The wsl2-dev installer created this file and never changes or removes it.
" After adding a line, run :PlugInstall.
"
" Examples:
"   Plug 'mhinz/vim-startify'           " a start screen with recent files
"   Plug 'dkarter/bullets.vim'          " Markdown lists
"   Plug 'jpalardy/vim-slime', { 'for': 'python' }   " send code to a tmux pane
